      "section": "Upstream: what the input can produce, not what it produces now",
      "text": "Upstream Production Capacity reads the input circuit's production capacity (as in 1.3.4). Reading current production capped every chain behind fuel generators at their present output, so downstream fuses blew whenever demand rose."
